msgstr "繁體中文"

msgid "English"
msgstr "English"

msgid "換個前進的方向"
msgstr "Change Your Focus Direction"

msgid "「走著走著如果發現走偏了，或者原來的挑戰已經結束，這很正常。換個新方向，之前的每頁痕跡依然會留在時間河流裡。」"
msgstr "\"If you find yourself drifting off course, or if your previous challenge is complete, that is completely normal. Setting a new direction won't erase the traces you've left in the river of time.\""

msgid "這段時間，你想試著專注的一件事是……"
msgstr "During this period, one thing you want to focus on is..."

msgid "例如：每天讀一篇短篇、或是每天給自己二十分鐘寫作"
msgstr "e.g., Read a short essay daily, or write for 20 minutes every day"

msgid "為什麼想換這個方向？ (初心，選填)"
msgstr "Why choose this direction? (Original intent, optional)"

msgid "寫給未來的自己一兩句心裡話"
msgstr "A word or two to your future self"

msgid "暫時不換"
msgstr "Keep Current"

msgid "確定定下新方向"
msgstr "Confirm New Focus"

msgid "「每天留下一點痕跡。不是為了變得更厲害，只是想知道如果一直記下去，我會變成什麼樣子。」"
msgstr "\"Leave a little trace every day. Not to become someone extraordinary, but simply to see who I will become if I keep recording.\""

msgid "《04_Story.md》第二章 • A Little Wonder 手作手帳"
msgstr "Chapter 02 • A Little Wonder Handcrafted Notebook"

msgid "《04_Story.md》第二章 • A Little Wonder Handcrafted Notebook"
msgstr "Chapter 02 • A Little Wonder Handcrafted Notebook"

msgid "第一頁 • 定錨前進方向"
msgstr "First Page • Anchor Goal"

msgid "First Page • Anchor Goal"
msgstr "First Page • Anchor Goal"

msgid "這段日子，你想走向哪裡？"
msgstr "Where do you want to head in the days ahead?"

msgid "不用是多麼偉大的誓言。可能只是：十四天完成一個微小工具、每天寫三行程式、或是每天留二十分鐘安靜坐著。"
msgstr "It doesn't have to be a grand vow. Maybe just: completing a tiny tool in 14 days, writing 3 lines of code daily, or sitting quietly for 20 minutes."

msgid "走著走著如果迷路或完成了，你隨時可以在頁首換個新方向。"
msgstr "If you lose your way or complete your quest, you can change direction anytime at the top of the page."

msgid "🎯 這段時間，我想試著專注的一件事是……"
msgstr "🎯 During this time, one thing I want to try focusing on is..."

msgid "例如：連續十四天，每天給自己留一點時間寫程式"
msgstr "e.g., For 14 days straight, set aside time each day to code"

msgid "簡短一句話即可，這將是這段日記的篇章標題。"
msgstr "A short sentence is enough; this will be the chapter title of this journal."

msgid "💡 為什麼想做這件事？ (初心與期待，選填)"
msgstr "💡 Why do you want to do this? (Original intent & hope, optional)"

msgid "例如：想知道想和做之間的距離，到底能不能被拉近一些。"
msgstr "e.g., Want to see if the distance between thought and action can truly be closed."

msgid "寫給未來某一天的自己看。"
msgstr "Written for a future day's self to read."

msgid "開始翻開日記，留下痕跡 ➔"
msgstr "Begin Journal, Leave Traces ➔"

msgid "開啟/退出純淨手帳專注模式 (Esc)"
msgstr "Toggle Zen Focus Mode (Esc)"

msgid "專注模式"
msgstr "Zen Mode"

msgid "退出專注 (Esc)"
msgstr "Exit Zen (Esc)"

msgid "切換為無拘無束的自由手帳模式"
msgstr "Switch to freehand sketch mode"

msgid "切換為自由速寫"
msgstr "Switch to Freehand"

msgid "切換為故事四問"
msgstr "Switch to Four Questions"

msgid "痕跡已蓋印留存"
msgstr "TRACE SEALED • Preserved"

msgid "今天的痕跡"
msgstr "Today's Traces"

msgid "墨跡已沉澱歸檔"
msgstr "Ink settled & archived"

msgid "墨水已備好，隨寫即存"
msgstr "Ink ready, auto-saving as you write"

msgid "今日天候：晴朗日光"
msgstr "Weather: Bright Daylight"

msgid "今日天候：濛濛細雨"
msgstr "Weather: Gentle Rain"

msgid "今日天候：寂靜深夜"
msgstr "Weather: Quiet Midnight"

