msgstr "Sunny"

msgid "雨"
msgstr "Rainy"

msgid "夜"
msgstr "Night"

msgid "心情：捕捉到靈光或小成就"
msgstr "Mood: Spark or small achievement"

msgid "心情：思緒繁雜混亂"
msgstr "Mood: Tangled & chaotic thoughts"

msgid "心情：有微小萌芽與新起點"
msgstr "Mood: Tiny sprout & fresh start"

msgid "微光"
msgstr "Sparks"

msgid "混亂"
msgstr "Chaos"

msgid "萌芽"
msgstr "Sprout"

msgid "1. 今天做了什麼？"
msgstr "1. What did you do today?"

msgid "(行動的痕跡，哪怕再微小)"
msgstr "(Traces of action, no matter how small)"

msgid "擲骰子換個靈感提示"
msgstr "Roll dice for an inspiration prompt"

msgid "換個提示"
msgstr "New Prompt"

msgid "• 寫了幾行程式、讀了一篇文章、嘗試解決了一個難題..."
msgstr "• Wrote a few lines of code, read an essay, tried solving a puzzle..."

msgid "2. 今天學到了什麼？"
msgstr "2. What did you learn today?"

msgid "(認知、技巧或微小頓悟)"
msgstr "(Insights, skills, or quiet realizations)"

msgid "• 發現了某個新方法、或是明白為什麼過去會卡住..."
msgstr "• Discovered a new method, or understood why you got stuck before..."

msgid "3. 哪裡失敗了？"
msgstr "3. Where did you fail?"

msgid "(誠實面對挫折、失控與阻礙)"
msgstr "(Honestly facing setbacks, chaos, and roadblocks)"

msgid "• 原本想做完卻沒搞定、因為煩躁放棄了某件事..."
msgstr "• Planned to finish but didn't, gave up on something out of annoyance..."

msgid "4. 為什麼不想做？ / 當下心情"
msgstr "4. Why didn't you want to do it? / Current Mood"

msgid "(誠實傾聽內心的抗拒)"
msgstr "(Honestly listening to inner resistance)"

msgid "• 覺得疲憊、害怕面對不確定性、心浮氣躁..."
msgstr "• Feeling exhausted, fearing uncertainty, feeling restless..."

msgid "今日自由手帳隨筆"
msgstr "Freehand Journal Notes Today"

msgid "(不拘形式，寫下腦海裡的混亂與文字)"
msgstr "(No rules—pour out raw thoughts, clutter, and words)"

msgid "在這裡隨意寫下今天的混亂、牢騷、嘗試或微小頓悟..."
msgstr "Write freely about today's clutter, complaints, attempts, or quiet epiphanies..."

msgid "即時字數統計與墨水量"
msgstr "Real-time word count & ink level"

msgid "字"
msgstr "words"

msgid "• 誠實寫下即可"
msgstr "• Just write honestly"

