msgstr "Today's Reflection • Settling the Chaos"

msgid "今日簡記"
msgstr "Today's Reflection"

msgid "頁緣觀察"
msgstr "Margin Observation"

msgid "靈魂提問"
msgstr "Soul Question"

msgid "靈魂提問："
msgstr "Soul Question: "

msgid "🕊️ 靈魂提問："
msgstr "🕊️ Soul Question: "

msgid "[今晚隨筆] 在這裡寫下今晚的一點體會（或直接闔上手帳，留給自己一夜沉澱）..."
msgstr "[Tonight's Note] Jot down an impression tonight (or close notebook and let it rest overnight)..."

msgid "留下今晚筆記"
msgstr "Seal Tonight's Note"

msgid "今晚手寫筆記："
msgstr "Tonight's Note: "

msgid "💬 今晚手寫筆記："
msgstr "💬 Tonight's Note: "

msgid "時間的回音"
msgstr "Echo of Time"

msgid "回望時光"
msgstr "Looking Back"

msgid "第二章｜留下痕跡"
msgstr "Chapter 02 | The Trace Log"

msgid "「回頭看才發現，有些事情我以為自己做了很多，其實根本沒有。有些事情我以為自己一直在失敗，卻已經比以前走遠了一點。」"
msgstr "\"Looking back, I realize that some things I thought I did a lot of, I actually didn't; and some things where I thought I was constantly failing, I had quietly moved forward.\""

msgid "手帳心法："
msgstr "Handbook Principle: "

msgid "不用強求每天都有豐功偉業。真實寫下抗拒與卡頓，本身就是最深邃的成長痕跡。"
msgstr "No need to force heroic deeds every day. Honestly writing down resistance and bottlenecks is itself the deepest trace of growth."

msgid "翻閱時間河流中的過往篇章"
msgstr "Browse past pages in the River of Time"

msgid "• 哪怕只是寫了兩行程式、讀了半篇文章，甚至是整理了書桌"
msgstr "• Even if it was just writing two lines of code, reading half an article, or tidying the desk"

msgid "• 哪怕只是鼓起勇氣打開了那個逃避好幾天的檔案"
msgstr "• Even if it was just gathering courage to open that file avoided for days"

msgid "• 哪怕只是坐在椅子上安靜思考了十分鐘接下來要先做什麼"
msgstr "• Even if it was just sitting quietly for ten minutes pondering what to do next"

msgid "• 發現了某個新工具或快捷鍵、或想通了為什麼之前會卡住"
msgstr "• Found a new tool or shortcut, or figured out why you were stuck before"

msgid "• 學到了：自己什麼時候精神最集中，什麼時候需要放空充電"
msgstr "• Learned: when your focus peaks, and when you need quiet recharging"

msgid "• 明白了一件事：慢慢做反而比焦急趕工走得更穩"
msgstr "• Realized: pacing steadily takes you further than rushing in panic"

msgid "• 原本打算做完卻中途滑了半小時手機，誠實寫下"
msgstr "• Intended to finish but scrolled phone for half an hour—write it honestly"

msgid "• 試了半天還是報錯，最後感到沮喪關掉了視窗"
msgstr "• Tried repeatedly yet got errors, closed the window in frustration"

msgid "• 承認自己今天真的沒在狀態，不用給自己道德審判"
msgstr "• Acknowledge that today wasn't your day—no moral judgment needed"

msgid "• 其實是害怕做出來不夠完美，所以遲遲不敢開始"
msgstr "• Really just afraid of imperfection, hence hesitating to begin"

msgid "• 只是純粹太疲憊了，大腦像浸了水一樣轉不動"
msgstr "• Simply drained—brain feels soaked and barely turning"

msgid "• 心裡在嘀咕這件事到底有沒有意義，感到盲目"
msgstr "• Questioning whether this has any meaning, feeling a bit lost"

msgid "已從本機還原未存草稿"
msgstr "Restored unsaved draft from local storage"

msgid "墨水書寫中..."
msgstr "Ink flowing..."

msgid "墨跡已自動隱入紙張"
msgstr "Ink automatically blended into paper"

msgid "【做了什麼】"
msgstr "[What I Did]"

msgid "【學到了什麼】"
msgstr "[What I Learned]"

msgid "【哪裡失敗了】"
msgstr "[Where I Failed]"

msgid "【失敗與卡住】"
msgstr "[Failures & Roadblocks]"

msgid "【抗拒與心情】"
msgstr "[Resistance & Mood]"

msgid "【手帳隨筆】"
msgstr "[Journal Notes]"

msgid "請至少留下一句今天的微小痕跡。"
msgstr "Please write down at least one tiny trace of today."

msgid "墨水風乾中..."
msgstr "Ink drying..."

msgid "今日痕跡已歸檔"
msgstr "Today's traces archived"

msgid "儲存失敗，請重試"
msgstr "Save failed, please try again"

msgid "連線失敗，請檢查網路連線"
msgstr "Connection failed, please check network"

msgid "今晚手寫筆記已烙印留存。"
msgstr "Tonight's handwritten note sealed."

msgid "保存失敗："
msgstr "Save failed: "

msgid "請填寫新的方向名稱"
msgstr "Please enter a name for the new direction"

msgid "設定失敗"
msgstr "Setup failed"

msgid "連線失敗，請稍後重試"
msgstr "Connection failed, please try again later"

msgid "蓋印於"
msgstr "Sealed at"

msgid "上一頁"
msgstr "Previous"

msgid "下一頁"
msgstr "Next"

msgid "第"
msgstr "Page"

msgid "頁 / 共"
msgstr "of"

msgid "時間河流裡還沒有任何痕跡。"
msgstr "There are no traces in the River of Time yet."

msgid "「萬事起頭難，只要記下今天的一兩句，這條河就會開始流動。」"
msgstr "\"All beginnings are hard. Just write down a line or two today, and this river will start flowing.\""

msgid "翻開手帳，留下第一筆痕跡"
msgstr "Open notebook & leave your first trace"

msgid "重溫隨機一頁"
msgstr "Relive a Random Page"

msgid "返回今日書寫"
msgstr "Back to Today's Journal"

msgid "章節過濾:"
msgstr "Filter by Chapter:"

msgid "全部痕跡"
msgstr "All Traces"

msgid "當前"
msgstr "Current"

msgid "隨機翻開一則過往的記憶痕跡"
msgstr "Flip to a random memory trace from the past"

msgid "Chapter 02 • The Trace Log"
msgstr "Chapter 02 • The Trace Log"

msgid "第二章 • 留下痕跡"
msgstr "Chapter 02 • The Trace Log"

msgid "留 下 痕 跡"
msgstr "The Trace Log"

msgid "不為變得更厲害，只為看清走過的路"
msgstr "Not to become extraordinary, just to see clearly the path walked"

msgid "「十四天結束後，我本來以為自己會很有成就感。結果沒有。"
msgstr "\"After the 14 days ended, I thought I would feel a great sense of accomplishment. But I didn't."

msgid "我只是看著那十四格，然後突然發現——我已經忘了自己前幾天到底做了什麼。"
msgstr "I was just looking at those 14 boxes, and suddenly realized—I had already forgotten what I did in the earlier days."

msgid "於是，我開始每天記一點東西。今天做了什麼。學了什麼。哪裡失敗了。有時候，連今天為什麼不想做，都記下來。」"
msgstr "So I began to write down a little something every day. What I did. What I learned. Where I failed. Sometimes, even why I didn't feel like doing anything today.\""

msgid "使用 Google 帳號翻開手帳"
msgstr "Open Notebook with Google Account"

msgid "[開發測試] 一鍵以探索者帳號翻開手帳"
msgstr "[Dev Test] Open Notebook with Explorer Account"

msgid "純粹紙筆觸感 • 本地私密保存 • 無科技喧囂"
msgstr "Pure tactile paper feel • Private & local • Free of tech noise"

